-- Tests for Part 1, Part I (definitions) and Part II (Articles 1, 2, 3, 6, 7, 8, 9).
-- Every expected value was worked out by hand from the source before the assertion was run;
-- the arithmetic is beside it. A failing assertion here is a finding, never a value to edit.
-- Scenario figures (dates, sums insured, premiums) are the fixtures'; the figures the
-- document prints (7 days, 70%, 15 days, 01 year, 90 days, 03 years) are named where used.

§ `Tests — definitions and general provisions`

§§ `Definition 5 — a car`

-- src:44 | 5. “Xe ô tô” bao gồm xe ô tô con, xe bán tải, xe tải, xe khách, xe buýt, rơ moóc hoặc sơ mi rơ moóc được kéo bởi ô
-- src:45 | tô đầu kéo.... Không bao gồm xe mô tô hai bánh, xe mô tô ba bánh, xe gắn máy, xe đạp điện, xe máy điện và các
-- src:46 | loại xe tương tự.
#ASSERT `definition 5 — a car` `a passenger car`
#ASSERT `definition 5 — a car` `a truck`
#ASSERT `definition 5 — a car` `a trailer or semi-trailer drawn by a tractor unit`
#ASSERT NOT `definition 5 — a car` `a two-wheeled motorcycle`
#ASSERT NOT `definition 5 — a car` `an electric motorbike`
#ASSERT NOT `definition 5 — a car` `a vehicle similar to those excluded`
#ASSERT REFUSED `definition 5 — a car` `another kind of motor vehicle` BECAUSE "definition 5 does not say whether this kind of vehicle is a car"

-- A motorcycle is turned away by definition 5 in the Part 1 answer.
#ASSERT `the reasons in` (`Part 1 — the answer to` (`a claim for` `the standard collision`) `under` (`the standard policy on` (`a vehicle of kind` `a two-wheeled motorcycle`))) EQUALS LIST `the vehicle is not a car within definition 5`

§§ `Definition 7 — time in use`

-- First registered June 2024, contract concluded January 2026: elapsed months,
-- (2026 × 12 + 1) − (2024 × 12 + 6) = 19.
